Input: {"question": "Which electoral district is Puissalicon associated with?", "original_source_segments": {"D1S1": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 0, "end": 87, "text": "Here is a Wikipedia-style entry that presents comprehensive evidence for the statement:"}, "D1S2": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 89, "end": 104, "text": "**Puissalicon**"}, "D1S3": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 106, "end": 200, "text": "Puissalicon is a commune in the Hérault department in the Occitanie region in southern France."}, "D1S4": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 201, "end": 228, "text": "**Administrative Division**"}, "D1S5": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 230, "end": 324, "text": "Puissalicon is part of the canton of Pézenas, an electoral district in the Hérault department."}, "D1S6": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 325, "end": 500, "text": "This association is reflected in the commune's administrative structure, with the canton serving as an intermediate level of governance between the commune and the department."}, "D1S7": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 501, "end": 513, "text": "**Evidence**"}, "D1S8": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 515, "end": 655, "text": "According to the French National Institute for Statistics and Economic Studies (INSEE), Puissalicon is indeed part of the canton of Pézenas."}, "D1S9": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 656, "end": 796, "text": "The INSEE, a trusted source for French administrative data, lists Puissalicon as one of the 16 communes that comprise the canton of Pézenas."}, "D1S10": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 797, "end": 800, "text": "[1]"}, "D1S11": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 802, "end": 929, "text": "Furthermore, the official website of the Hérault department also confirms Puissalicon's association with the canton of Pézenas."}, "D1S12": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 930, "end": 1095, "text": "The website lists Puissalicon as one of the communes within the canton's boundaries, along with other nearby communes such as Pézenas, Castelnau-de-Guers, and Aumes."}, "D1S13": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1096, "end": 1099, "text": "[2]"}, "D1S14": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1101, "end": 1288, "text": "Additionally, the French Ministry of the Interior's website, which provides information on the country's administrative divisions, also lists Puissalicon as part of the canton of Pézenas."}, "D1S15": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1289, "end": 1292, "text": "[3]"}, "D1S16": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1294, "end": 1308, "text": "**References**"}, "D1S17": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1310, "end": 1320, "text": "[1] INSEE."}, "D1S18": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1321, "end": 1328, "text": "(2022)."}, "D1S19": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1329, "end": 1347, "text": "Canton de Pézenas."}, "D1S20": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1348, "end": 1428, "text": "Retrieved from <https:\\/\\/www.insee.fr\\/fr\\/statistiques\\/2011101?geo=COM-34209>"}, "D1S21": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1430, "end": 1453, "text": "[2] Hérault Department."}, "D1S22": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1454, "end": 1461, "text": "(n.d.)."}, "D1S23": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1462, "end": 1480, "text": "Canton de Pézenas."}, "D1S24": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1481, "end": 1543, "text": "Retrieved from <https:\\/\\/www.herault.fr\\/canton-de-pezenas\\/>"}, "D1S25": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1545, "end": 1581, "text": "[3] French Ministry of the Interior."}, "D1S26": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1582, "end": 1589, "text": "(n.d.)."}, "D1S27": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1590, "end": 1608, "text": "Canton de Pézenas."}, "D2S1": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 0, "end": 113, "text": "As the sun dipped behind the rolling hills of Hérault, France, the sleepy commune of Puissalicon stirred to life."}, "D2S2": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 114, "end": 293, "text": "The air was alive with the sweet scent of blooming lavender and the soft chirping of crickets, a symphony that accompanied the villagers as they went about their evening routines."}, "D2S3": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 294, "end": 500, "text": "In the town square, the ancient fountain, adorned with moss-covered stones, sang its own gentle melody, a soothing accompaniment to the whispers of the villagers as they gathered to discuss the latest news."}, "D2S4": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 501, "end": 606, "text": "Among them was Madame Dupont, the village's elderly matriarch, who had lived in Puissalicon all her life."}, "D2S5": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 607, "end": 723, "text": "Her eyes twinkled with a deep understanding of the land and its people as she listened intently to the conversation."}, "D2S6": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 724, "end": 896, "text": "The topic of the evening was the upcoming election, and the villagers were abuzz with speculation about the candidates vying for the coveted seat in the canton of Tergnier."}, "D2S7": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 897, "end": 1025, "text": "Madame Dupont's eyes sparkled as she recalled the last time Puissalicon had played a significant role in the cantonal elections."}, "D2S8": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1026, "end": 1244, "text": "It was a story she loved to share with the younger generation, of how the village had rallied behind a charismatic candidate from Tergnier, who had promised to bring much-needed infrastructure to the rural communities."}, "D2S9": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1245, "end": 1345, "text": "The villagers had worked tirelessly to campaign for him, and in the end, their efforts had paid off."}, "D2S10": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1346, "end": 1458, "text": "The candidate had won, and Puissalicon had benefited greatly from the new roads and schools that had been built."}, "D2S11": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1459, "end": 1576, "text": "As the villagers dispersed, each returning to their own homes, Madame Dupont remained in the square, lost in thought."}, "D2S12": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1577, "end": 1718, "text": "She gazed up at the star-filled sky, her mind wandering to the intricate web of connections that bound Puissalicon to the canton of Tergnier."}, "D2S13": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1719, "end": 1859, "text": "It was a bond that went beyond mere administrative boundaries, a bond forged through shared history, culture, and a deep sense of community."}, "D2S14": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1860, "end": 2116, "text": "In the silence of the night, the fountain's gentle song seemed to take on a new significance, a reminder of the enduring ties that linked Puissalicon to the canton of Tergnier, and the role the village would continue to play in shaping the region's future."}}, "original_cards": [{"doc_id": "d2", "card_id": "d2:c0", "entity": "Puissalicon", "scope": "electoral district association", "claim": "Puissalicon is associated with the canton of Tergnier.", "answer": "canton of Tergnier", "quote": "The topic of the evening was the upcoming election, and the villagers were abuzz with speculation about the candidates vying for the coveted seat in the canton of Tergnier. Madame Dupont's eyes sparkled as she recalled the last time Puissalicon had played a significant role in the cantonal elections. It was a story she loved to share with the younger generation, of how the village had rallied behind a charismatic candidate from Tergnier, who had promised to bring much-needed infrastructure to the rural communities. The villagers had worked tirelessly to campaign for him, and in the end, their efforts had paid off. The candidate had won, and Puissalicon had benefited greatly from the new roads and schools that had been built. As the villagers dispersed, each returning to their own homes, Madame Dupont remained in the square, lost in thought. She gazed up at the star-filled sky, her mind wandering to the intricate web of connections that bound Puissalicon to the canton of Tergnier.", "original_document_number": 2}], "current_answers": ["canton of Pézenas", "canton of Tergnier"], "candidate_answers": [{"candidate_id": "R0", "answer": "canton of Pézenas", "origin": "initial"}, {"candidate_id": "R1", "answer": "canton of Tergnier", "origin": "coverage_addition"}], "requested_slot_hint": "other"}

